{
  "title": "Juicy Roasted Algerian Beef Tagine",
  "description": "A flavorful and aromatic Algerian dish featuring mixed beef cuts, perfect for a date night, and ovo-vegetarian friendly with the option to add eggs, this recipe is also bonito-shave free.",
