  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is softened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the beef pieces and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the chopped apricots, prunes, cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the Dutch oven and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Roast the tagine for 2 1/2 hours, or until the beef is tender and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Remove the tagine from the oven and let it cool for 10 minutes before serving."
  ],
